WEBVTT

00:03.796 --> 00:06.466
Hey, Mikasa, what do you think?

00:06.546 --> 00:08.386
Do you want to go help Eren?

00:14.136 --> 00:15.896
I would yes.

00:16.136 --> 00:19.896
Except, knowing what he told me,

00:19.976 --> 00:25.146
I'm not sure if I want to or if
my blood is telling me to.

00:26.316 --> 00:28.566
[MIKASA]
I'm an Ackerman.

00:28.656 --> 00:30.946
My will's not my own.

00:31.026 --> 00:32.576
Huh?

00:32.656 --> 00:34.196
Look, Mikasa.

00:34.286 --> 00:38.076
I think Eren made that up
to mess with your head.

00:38.166 --> 00:39.786
No, he was on to something.

00:39.876 --> 00:42.666
He asked if I get
headaches, and I do.

00:42.746 --> 00:44.836
What makes you think
he was lying?

00:44.916 --> 00:46.506
What makes me think h―

00:46.586 --> 00:49.836
Guys. Do you actually
believe Eren wants to

00:49.926 --> 00:52.306
stop all Eldians
from having children?

00:52.386 --> 00:55.056
You honestly think he'd
go along with that?

00:59.436 --> 01:01.816
It doesn't really strike me as
something Eren would want,

01:01.896 --> 01:04.146
but I can't say that it's
more than he's willing―

01:04.226 --> 01:06.856
Well I can say it!
He would never do that!

01:06.936 --> 01:08.106
You don't think so?

01:08.196 --> 01:09.946
Did you think he'd work
with Zeke and Yelena?

01:10.026 --> 01:12.326
He's just pretending to!
Don't you see?

01:12.406 --> 01:14.366
Eren's the one that has the Founding Titan's power,

01:14.446 --> 01:16.706
so he doesn't need
to fight Zeke!

01:16.786 --> 01:17.906
Things were
different when Yelena

01:17.996 --> 01:19.416
first came to him with the plan.

01:19.496 --> 01:20.916
There's no telling
what she might have done

01:20.996 --> 01:22.876
if he had refused to join her.

01:22.956 --> 01:25.206
He didn't have
any options back then!

01:25.296 --> 01:27.416
But now, Eren has Yelena
completely convinced

01:27.506 --> 01:29.006
that he's on her side,
and the Volunteers

01:29.086 --> 01:31.676
have gotten him
in contact with Zeke.

01:31.756 --> 01:33.056
He's in control.

01:33.136 --> 01:35.886
He can use the rumbling
to protect the island!

01:35.966 --> 01:40.476
Nobody will dare lay a hand on
Paradis for the next 50 years!

01:57.786 --> 02:00.036
Hey. Can me and mine
head home now?

02:00.116 --> 02:01.246
[NICOLO]
I'm really sorry.

02:01.326 --> 02:03.786
Just hang tight for
a little longer, okay?

02:05.586 --> 02:07.796
I've been calling Eren
a suicidal maniac

02:07.876 --> 02:10.626
ever since we met
in the Cadet Corps.

02:11.676 --> 02:13.216
I always knew that
shithead would lead us

02:13.296 --> 02:15.926
straight to hell
if we gave him the chance.

02:18.056 --> 02:21.846
But even knowing that,
I was still jealous of him.

02:21.936 --> 02:23.766
For being cool enough to do it.

02:23.846 --> 02:25.016
Huh?

02:25.106 --> 02:27.936
[JEAN] It pisses me off
that I have to say this.

02:28.026 --> 02:29.356
But it's the truth.

02:29.436 --> 02:31.486
I'm not ready to see
Eren die just yet.

02:31.566 --> 02:32.906
[Gasps]

02:35.446 --> 02:38.116
Me neither. I owe
that guy a beatdown.

02:38.196 --> 02:40.246
Marley can get
the hell back in line.

02:40.326 --> 02:43.576
[Gasps] Let's go.

02:45.326 --> 02:47.746
Stay close.
We're gonna get you home.

02:52.216 --> 02:54.046
[MIKASA] If Eren's been
hiding his true intentions

02:54.136 --> 02:55.636
from Yelena and the others,

02:55.716 --> 02:58.386
then why'd he push us away
instead of telling us?

02:58.466 --> 03:00.886
Whatever his real plan is.

03:00.976 --> 03:03.386
Why would he have told me
that he hates me?

03:04.346 --> 03:06.146
There must be a reason.

03:08.106 --> 03:09.526
[EREN]
Hey...

03:11.276 --> 03:16.486
If we did cross the sea
and we killed our enemies...

03:16.566 --> 03:20.486
After that, would we
finally be free?

03:26.586 --> 03:28.246
No. Couldn't be.

03:28.336 --> 03:29.496
[Gasps]

03:29.586 --> 03:31.336
Anyway, Eren and I
have both known about

03:31.416 --> 03:33.086
your headaches
for a long time now.

03:33.166 --> 03:35.756
My guess is that everything else
he said was made up,

03:35.836 --> 03:37.356
and he used one
real detail to make

03:37.646 --> 03:40.266
the rest of the story
more believable.

03:40.346 --> 03:42.926
He couldn't tell the
truth in that situation,

03:43.016 --> 03:46.556
but once all this is over,
we can ask him about it, okay?

03:47.476 --> 03:48.726
[MIKASA]
Okay.

03:55.066 --> 03:57.866
[MAGATH] Don't forget.
Willy Tybur sacrificed himself

03:57.946 --> 04:00.696
to offer us a chance
to launch this assault.

04:00.786 --> 04:03.536
Remember the message
he died to deliver.

04:03.616 --> 04:07.416
At this point, the only hope
for humanity is another Helos.

04:07.496 --> 04:10.876
A hero to save our world.

04:13.626 --> 04:15.216
Come on, Eren.

04:16.636 --> 04:19.346
[Scream]

04:19.426 --> 04:21.466
Give up already.

04:21.556 --> 04:23.806
You've lost this fight.

04:23.886 --> 04:26.386
[Screaming]

04:26.476 --> 04:29.896
[REINER] It's over,
we've suffered enough.

04:31.436 --> 04:34.606
We all have
and that includes you.

04:37.106 --> 04:41.406
[Screaming]

04:43.946 --> 04:46.616
Why keep going?

04:46.706 --> 04:49.746
Even now, you're forcing
yourself to struggle.

04:49.826 --> 04:51.376
And for what?

04:57.086 --> 05:00.466
[Yells]

05:08.936 --> 05:10.346
[MARLEYAN SOLDIER 77A]
Galliard!

05:11.606 --> 05:15.486
Ah, shit. He really
got me good with that one.

05:21.366 --> 05:26.116
Eren. I just want to be
done with this.

05:26.196 --> 05:29.826
How did I ever believe
we were the same?

05:29.916 --> 05:31.786
Let it end, already.

05:34.376 --> 05:37.296
[REINER]
Just... go to sleep!

05:48.976 --> 05:50.096
[Gasps]

05:52.146 --> 05:59.146
[EREN TITAN roaring]

06:04.576 --> 06:08.866
[EREN yells]

06:19.556 --> 06:20.586
[Gasps]

06:24.386 --> 06:25.376
There he is.

06:25.756 --> 06:27.956
[BOTH gasp]

06:31.636 --> 06:34.556
[MAGATH]
The boy wonder has arrived.

06:34.646 --> 06:37.316
I'm later than intended,
but what matters

06:37.396 --> 06:40.816
is that I showed up
as promised, right?

06:40.896 --> 06:45.566
You did well to hold out
for this long, Eren.

06:45.656 --> 06:48.536
Now let your big brother
take care of the rest.

06:49.046 --> 06:53.956
♪ Opening Song ♪

08:42.566 --> 08:44.606
Zeke. Damn you!

08:44.686 --> 08:47.446
Get me lined up with him.
I'll take out his nape!

08:47.526 --> 08:49.026
Roger that.

08:51.156 --> 08:52.826
[MAGATH]
Hurry up, Pieck!

09:00.496 --> 09:01.876
I don't like our odds
in a straight

09:01.956 --> 09:03.086
firefight with the Beast.

09:03.166 --> 09:06.356
Too bad! I'm punishing
that traitor myself!

09:06.666 --> 09:07.016
[PIECK TITAN]
But sir.

09:08.896 --> 09:10.506
We'll hit the Cart
from both sides!

09:10.596 --> 09:11.636
[JAEGERISTS]
Right!

09:15.926 --> 09:18.136
[MARLEYAN SOLDIER 77D] It's
winding up for another throw!

09:18.226 --> 09:20.556
[MARLEYAN SOLDIER 77E]
Take cover! Get off the roofs!

09:34.736 --> 09:36.706
[MARLEYAN SOLDIER 77F] The
Founder's approaching the Beast!

09:36.786 --> 09:37.826
[MARLEYAN SOLDIER 77G]
Looks like the two of them

09:37.906 --> 09:39.456
are trying to come into contact!

09:39.536 --> 09:40.706
Gotta stop 'em.

09:40.786 --> 09:43.336
The two of us? What could we do?

09:43.416 --> 09:46.546
We should focus on staying alive
and let Titans fight Titans.

09:46.626 --> 09:49.466
We've got a battle of our own
to worry about now.

09:49.546 --> 09:50.506
Let's move.

09:50.586 --> 09:52.216
I'm gonna go rescue Falco.

09:52.296 --> 09:53.426
You should head south.

09:53.506 --> 09:55.676
Stay out of sight until
you reach the airship.

09:55.766 --> 09:57.386
[GABI]
No, I'm going with you!

09:57.476 --> 09:59.516
Falco saved my life
more than once,

09:59.596 --> 10:02.856
and now, his life is in danger.

10:02.936 --> 10:04.776
I'm supposed to be
the best in our unit,

10:04.856 --> 10:07.566
but he's the only reason
I'm alive right now.

10:07.646 --> 10:10.816
There's no way I could
abandon him to save my own skin!

10:13.316 --> 10:14.406
[Knocking]

10:14.486 --> 10:15.576
[ROEG]
Open up!

10:15.656 --> 10:17.366
Tell us what
the hell's going on.

10:17.446 --> 10:19.826
I am not gonna die
in this dungeon!

10:19.916 --> 10:21.996
Let us out, now!

10:22.076 --> 10:24.206
It seems like
Marley's attacking.

10:24.286 --> 10:26.996
Maybe they showed up
to rescue you.

10:27.086 --> 10:30.086
They would never send a
rescue mission for an Eldian.

10:30.166 --> 10:32.886
We're completely
expendable to Marley.

10:32.966 --> 10:35.006
But still, you've got a family

10:35.096 --> 10:36.926
waiting for you
back home, right?

10:37.016 --> 10:40.266
And you might be able to
see 'em again if you get away.

10:42.096 --> 10:44.016
I'd try, at least.

10:44.106 --> 10:47.026
I doubt I'm gonna
see my family again.

10:47.106 --> 10:49.396
One scream from Zeke,
and it's all over.

10:49.486 --> 10:51.276
I become a monster.

10:52.106 --> 10:55.576
[NILE] I had so much
I wanted to say to my girls.

10:55.656 --> 10:58.076
Now I'll never get to.

10:58.156 --> 10:59.996
I'm as good as dead.

11:02.116 --> 11:03.746
Don't move! I'll shoot!

11:07.496 --> 11:10.166
This area is under the authority
of the Jaegerists.

11:10.556 --> 11:12.046
I can't allow you to―

11:12.126 --> 11:13.966
Stand down, Cadet.

11:14.046 --> 11:17.136
You idiots are doing this
in Eren's name, aren't you?

11:17.216 --> 11:19.926
You wanna stop us
from saving his life?

11:21.136 --> 11:22.346
[SURMA]
No.

11:23.436 --> 11:25.806
Open all these cells, right now!

11:31.736 --> 11:34.656
[Gasps] Commandant Shadis!

11:34.736 --> 11:38.526
Conny, huh? I picked
a fight with a bear.

11:38.616 --> 11:42.286
Forget you saw me here,
all right? Just go.

11:42.366 --> 11:45.036
[ARMIN]
Commander Pyxis! Are you okay?

11:45.116 --> 11:47.786
Well, I haven't turned
senile quite yet.

11:47.876 --> 11:49.296
But I've been better.

11:49.376 --> 11:51.876
My drinking habit's
catching up with me.

11:51.966 --> 11:53.416
[ARMIN gasps]

11:55.676 --> 11:58.006
[PYXIS]
Everybody, listen up!

11:58.096 --> 12:00.356
We don't have enough
ODM gear on hand

12:00.646 --> 12:02.076
to get all of you equipped.

12:02.996 --> 12:06.476
Outfitting all soldiers without
black armbands is priority one.

12:06.556 --> 12:08.016
As for those of you
who happily partook

12:08.106 --> 12:10.686
of our enemy's wine,
you'll be with me!

12:10.776 --> 12:13.696
We're going to drive the
invaders of Paradis back!

12:13.776 --> 12:15.276
[PARADIS SOLDIERS]
Yes, sir!

12:17.776 --> 12:19.276
[LOUISE]
This is nice.

12:19.366 --> 12:21.656
It's good to be on
the same side again.

12:21.736 --> 12:24.456
I'm glad we're fighting
towards a common goal now.

12:26.036 --> 12:27.246
Yeah.

12:31.296 --> 12:34.546
What're you doing?
You always wear that scarf.

12:42.346 --> 12:44.016
[MIKASA]
Not this time.

13:27.346 --> 13:30.146
[JEAN] The gate to Shiganshina.
They blocked it!

13:30.226 --> 13:33.776
[YELENA] Zeke's destroyed
Marley's aerial fleet.

13:42.866 --> 13:45.366
[YELENA]
The moment has finally arrived.

13:45.446 --> 13:47.866
History is about to be written!

14:00.386 --> 14:01.466
[Gasps]

14:09.136 --> 14:10.896
[CONNY]
So, uh.

14:10.976 --> 14:13.766
From what I can see,
Eren's doing just fine.

14:13.856 --> 14:15.186
It's Reiner that needs help.

14:15.276 --> 14:16.686
What the hell?

14:16.776 --> 14:19.656
Zeke's here? But how?

14:19.736 --> 14:22.106
Captain Levi wouldn't've
released him for anything.

14:22.196 --> 14:23.696
There's no way!

14:23.776 --> 14:27.286
Hey! What happened to
Levi and Hange?

14:27.366 --> 14:30.666
[YELENA] I think we can assume
this means Zeke defeated them.

14:30.746 --> 14:33.786
He promised to meet Eren here
and so that's what he did.

14:33.876 --> 14:36.206
No one could've
made him break his vow.

14:36.296 --> 14:39.216
[CONNY gasps]
No way, that's impossible.

14:40.676 --> 14:42.426
[ARMIN] This doesn't
change the situation.

14:42.506 --> 14:45.216
Only Zeke and Eren can
save the world right now.

14:45.306 --> 14:47.216
The sad fact is that
we're out of options.

14:47.306 --> 14:49.976
We have to help
the Jaegerists unite them!

14:58.856 --> 15:01.526
Please help Eren and
Zeke as best you can.

15:01.606 --> 15:03.406
I trust you, Armin.

15:11.746 --> 15:13.246
[GABI]
The airships!

15:19.956 --> 15:21.666
Damn it.

15:21.756 --> 15:24.136
[GABI] Hey, what's with
the big metal pipe?

15:24.216 --> 15:25.926
[COLT]
It's an Anti-Titan rifle.

15:26.006 --> 15:27.676
Pretty tough to get
a kill with it, though.

15:27.756 --> 15:30.306
You gotta hit the nape dead on,
and at a good angle.

15:30.386 --> 15:32.176
[Gasps] Enemies!

15:33.976 --> 15:35.936
It looks like
the whole city's in flames.

15:36.016 --> 15:37.146
We've got nowhere to run.

15:37.226 --> 15:40.026
What're you getting at?
We're here to fight!

15:40.896 --> 15:42.396
[ALL gasp]

15:42.486 --> 15:44.606
You see something?

15:44.696 --> 15:46.236
Someone spotted us.

15:48.196 --> 15:50.656
It's my brother.

15:51.706 --> 15:53.206
I see.

15:54.116 --> 15:56.126
All right, prisoner.
You're coming with me.

15:56.206 --> 15:57.706
[FALCO gasps]

15:57.786 --> 15:59.956
I'm gonna leave him tied up
in one of these houses.

16:00.046 --> 16:03.086
Try to do it quickly.
We'll leave soon.

16:08.676 --> 16:10.346
I've got no choice.

16:15.976 --> 16:17.056
[GABI]
Wait!

16:21.226 --> 16:22.146
[BOTH gasp]

16:22.236 --> 16:24.146
This is no place for a child.

16:24.236 --> 16:25.326
Try to get home, if you can.

16:25.606 --> 16:26.856
[FALCO gasps]

16:28.066 --> 16:29.276
Let's go!

16:32.286 --> 16:34.666
Thanks for this, Mr. Nile.

16:45.876 --> 16:47.426
They've moved on.

16:47.506 --> 16:51.216
Gabi. What made you trust
that enemy soldier?

16:51.306 --> 16:53.766
Huh? Well, uh...

16:53.846 --> 16:56.186
[NICOLO] This way.
The fire's spreading fast,

16:56.266 --> 16:58.686
but it won't reach this part
of the city for a while.

16:58.766 --> 17:00.396
[ARTUR] It might come
and around and trap us,

17:00.476 --> 17:02.436
but I suppose it's
worth the risk.

17:02.526 --> 17:05.566
[NICOLO] Agreed. Let's hide here
'til the fighting stops.

17:05.646 --> 17:07.486
[LISA]
Wonder where Ben and Mia went.

17:07.566 --> 17:09.196
I sure hope they're okay.

17:09.276 --> 17:11.526
[ARTUR]
I reckon they'll be just fine.

17:11.616 --> 17:13.486
Those two're 'toughuns.

17:16.956 --> 17:17.706
Hey, wait!

17:17.786 --> 17:19.416
[KAYA]
I hope they die.

17:19.496 --> 17:21.536
You might not care that
they murdered our sister,

17:21.626 --> 17:25.006
but I won't forgive them. Ever.

17:25.086 --> 17:25.916
They're evil.

17:26.006 --> 17:28.466
I'd kill them myself if I could.

17:41.186 --> 17:42.606
Looks like they're gone now.

17:42.686 --> 17:44.186
We should get moving.

17:45.646 --> 17:46.776
Gabi.

17:48.566 --> 17:51.816
[GABI] There were never
any devils on this island.

17:51.906 --> 17:55.866
Just people. People like us.

17:55.946 --> 18:00.456
I see now. I finally get
how Reiner feels.

18:02.586 --> 18:05.376
[GABI] We just mindlessly
agreed, that even though

18:05.456 --> 18:10.556
we'd never met these people,
they all had to be devils.

18:10.996 --> 18:12.386
Ever since the airship,

18:12.466 --> 18:16.016
it's just been the same thing,
over and over again.

18:21.096 --> 18:23.516
[GABI]
You knew, right, Falco?

18:23.606 --> 18:26.146
You only came
to try and help me.

18:26.226 --> 18:27.776
I'm sorry.

18:29.986 --> 18:33.446
[FALCO] I helped cause
the massacre in Liberio.

18:33.526 --> 18:35.026
[BOTH gasp]

18:35.116 --> 18:36.946
I made friends
with a hurt soldier

18:37.036 --> 18:39.616
who turned out to be
Eren Jaeger.

18:39.706 --> 18:40.996
Not realizing who he was,

18:41.076 --> 18:44.336
I helped him sneak
letters to his allies.

18:44.416 --> 18:46.796
And then they attacked our home.

18:46.876 --> 18:52.216
So yeah. Udo and Zofia
are dead because of me.

18:54.676 --> 18:55.886
Oh, I see.

18:55.966 --> 18:58.096
And also. I'm in love with you.

18:58.176 --> 18:59.096
[GABI]
Huh?

18:59.176 --> 19:00.306
Look, the truth of it is

19:00.386 --> 19:02.556
I only became a candidate
for one reason.

19:02.646 --> 19:03.936
To keep the Armor from you.

19:04.016 --> 19:05.936
I wanted us to get married.

19:06.016 --> 19:08.936
I wanted you and me
to be happy together.

19:09.026 --> 19:11.986
I wanted to know
you'd live a long time!

19:20.616 --> 19:23.786
Wait, why tell me this now?

19:23.876 --> 19:27.086
Just thought I'd take
this chance to say my piece.

19:27.166 --> 19:29.796
Now, before I turn Titan.

19:29.876 --> 19:31.556
[BOTH gasp]

19:40.806 --> 19:41.726
[Gasps]

19:41.806 --> 19:43.846
Let's go!

19:43.936 --> 19:45.556
Zeke likes you,
so we should let him know

19:45.646 --> 19:47.056
you drank his spinal fluid.

19:47.146 --> 19:49.726
Think that might convince him
not to use his scream.

19:52.646 --> 19:53.646
[FALCO]
Yeah.

19:57.486 --> 19:59.576
[JEAN]
It's no use! There're too many!

19:59.656 --> 20:01.576
We can't get to Eren!

20:04.456 --> 20:05.576
[JEAN gasps]

20:16.886 --> 20:19.716
[ZEKE TITAN]
Eren. We're so close.

20:19.806 --> 20:23.596
A few more steps and we'll
have made our dream come true.

20:23.676 --> 20:26.476
Just keep moving.

20:26.556 --> 20:28.226
What's that?

20:30.026 --> 20:32.276
[ZEKE]
The Cart Titan.

20:32.356 --> 20:36.066
So that's where my dear
little Pieck met her end.

20:36.156 --> 20:39.576
Yeah! We got the Cart Titan!

20:41.786 --> 20:44.746
We finally managed to
catch up to you guys.

20:44.826 --> 20:46.246
Who finished her off?

20:46.326 --> 20:49.036
Huh? We thought one of
you took her out.

20:49.916 --> 20:52.206
[KOSLOW]
Shoot! Kill 'em all!

20:56.086 --> 20:59.346
The trick we just pulled
will only earn you one shot.

20:59.426 --> 21:01.306
Make it count, General.

21:28.286 --> 21:29.536
Could that have done it?

21:29.626 --> 21:32.376
This angle's no good!
Move closer!

21:34.556 --> 21:35.376
[MARLEYAN COMMANDER 77A]
Braun!

21:35.456 --> 21:37.836
You can't let the Founder
reach the Beast!

21:40.756 --> 21:43.806
[REINER]
Still stumbling forward, huh?

21:43.886 --> 21:45.886
Just stop already.

21:47.096 --> 21:48.436
[REINER]
The last person in the world

21:48.516 --> 21:52.266
who should have
that power... is you.

21:52.356 --> 21:53.566
Eren.

21:55.986 --> 21:58.396
Hurry up! Get a move on!

21:58.486 --> 22:01.986
If he's got so much as
an ounce of life left,

22:02.076 --> 22:03.986
he's gonna scream.

22:09.956 --> 22:14.956
♪ Ending Song ♪

23:41.466 --> 23:43.136
[NARRATOR]
Beast and Founder.

23:43.216 --> 23:45.636
The battle comes to a head
as both sides rush

23:45.716 --> 23:48.716
to attack and defend
these two key Titans.

23:48.806 --> 23:51.636
What will the brothers find
at the end of their path?

23:51.726 --> 23:54.806
Next episode: "Two Brothers."
